        V2 --> V4[VLAN 200: MetalLB Ingress & Workload Traffic]
        V3 --> V5[Static Node IP: 10.200.0.10/24 / Gateway: 10.200.0.1]
    end

    Stage1 -.->|Subiquity Writes Netplan Config| Stage2Plus
